  "details": "I have had troubles trying to stay logged in. All attempts to fix it have only done so temporarily, after a period of time, the issue returns.\nThe times I have to log in again are whenever I switch worlds, or start the game. The signs that I have to log in again are the worlds, my friends, and my saved avatars becoming inaccessible, along with me being unable to select avatars from avatar worlds.\nThis issue has lasted since Dec 1st, 2020 so far, and I was made aware of this when I tried to pull the game up after a 4 month hiatus from it.\nI am unsure of when this issue actually manifested besides the aforementioned date.",
